hecks":[{"at":"T+24h","status":"no_report_after_deadline","note":""},{"at":"T+14d","status":"no_report_after_deadline","note":""}],"reported":null,"day_incidents":[],"search_scope":"Searched every STEERS emissions event starting 12/28/2024 in Harris County (0 found; search complete). No matching report found in a complete search."},"corridor":{"origin_site_id":"48_201_1015","half_width_deg":22.5,"max_km":15.0,"wind_from_deg":[226.0,184.0]},"packet":{"draft_en":"On December 28, 2024, the Texas state monitor at Lynchburg Ferry recorded 32.63 ppb of benzene in the 11:00 p.m. CST hour, against a 7-day median of 0.255 ppb. Wind there came from 184 degrees at 1.6 mph. 54 major permitted facilities lie in the upwind corridor. No matching report found in a complete search of that day's emissions-event records for Harris County. That does not show who or what caused the reading. Requested follow-up: confirm whether any facility in this corridor reported a release that hour.","draft_es":"El 28 de diciembre de 2024, el monitor estatal de Texas en Lynchburg Ferry registró 32.63 ppb de benceno en la hora de las 11:00 p. m. CST, frente a una mediana de 7 días de 0.255 ppb. El viento venía de 184 grados a 1.6 mph. Hay 54 instalaciones permitidas importantes en el corredor de donde venía el viento. No se encontró un informe correspondiente en una búsqueda completa de los registros de eventos de emisiones de ese día en el condado de Harris. Eso no indica quién o qué causó la lectura. Seguimiento solicitado: confirmar si alguna instalación en este corredor reportó una emisión a esa hora.","drafted_by":"template (deterministic, no AI)","guard":{"passed":true,"rejected":[]}},"cannot_say":["A matching report is not proof the facility caused every reading; other sources can add to a spike.","'Not yet reported' would not mean 'illegal': Texas requires a report only above a reportable quantity, and air readings cannot measure how much was released (30 TAC 101.201).","The upwind corridor co